  "prefLabel": "Ed 1018.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1018.01 Purpose. The purpose of the independent living services for older individuals who are blind program is to support projects that:\n\n(a) Provide any of the IL services as described in 34 CFR 367.3(b);\n\n(b) Conduct activities that will improve or expand services for older individuals who are blind; and\n\n(c) Conduct activities to help improve public understanding of the problems of older individuals who are blind.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, #2, and #3 at chapter heading for Ed 1000) #13231, eff 7-13-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ed1000.html"
